    "question": "Dictionary (Hash Map) (ডিকশনারি ও হ্যাশম্যাপ)",
    "answer": "\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span class=\"badge\" style=\"background:#2563eb; color:#ffffff; padding:3px 9px; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; font-size:12px;\">প্যাটার্ন: Hash Map</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4 style=\"color:#0f172a; margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:6px;\">📌 সমস্যা (Problem Statement):</h4>\n      <p style=\"color:#334155; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px;\">Dictionary কী-ভ্যালু জোড়া ধারণ করে। পাইথন ৩.৭+ এ ইনসার্শন অর্ডার সংরক্ষিত থাকে এবং গড় লুকআপ ও ইনসার্ট $O(1)$।</p>\n\n      <h4 style=\"color:#0f172a; margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:6px;\">📋 ইনপুট ও আউটপুট উদাহরণ (Input & Output Example):</h4>\n      <div class=\"code-box\" style=\"background:#0f172a; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:18px; border-left:4px solid #3b82f6;\">\n        <div class=\"code-header\" style=\"background:#1e293b; color:#94a3b8; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; padding:6px 12px;\"><span>Input & Output Specification</span></div>\n        <pre style=\"margin:0; padding:12px;\"><code style=\"color:#38bdf8; font-family:Consolas, Monaco, monospace; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.5;\">Input / Example:\nuser: {&#x27;name&#x27;: &#x27;Nazmul&#x27;, &#x27;role&#x27;: &#x27;SWE&#x27;, &#x27;level&#x27;: &#x27;Senior&#x27;}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4 style=\"color:#0f172a; margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:6px;\">💡 পাইথন সমাধান (Python Solution):</h4>\n      <div class=\"code-box\">\n        <div class=\"code-header\"><span>Python Solution</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">Copy</button></div>\n        <pre><code class=\"language-python\">user = {&#x27;name&#x27;: &#x27;Nazmul&#x27;, &#x27;role&#x27;: &#x27;SWE&#x27;}\nuser[&#x27;level&#x27;] = &#x27;Senior&#x27;  # Insert O(1)\nrole = user.get(&#x27;role&#x27;, &#x27;N/A&#x27;)</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4 style=\"color:#0f172a; margin-top:18px; margin-bottom:4px;\">🔍 লাইন বাই লাইন বিস্তারিত ব্যাখ্যা (Line-by-Line Analysis):</h4>\n      \n      <div style=\"overflow-x:auto; margin:16px 0;\">\n        <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size:13.5px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr style=\"background:#f8fafc; color:#1e293b; font-weight:700; border-bottom:2px solid #cbd5e1; text-align:left;\">\n              <th style=\"padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; text-align:center; width:50px;\">লাইন</th>\n              <th style=\"padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; width:38%;\">কোড</th>\n              <th style=\"padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">বাংলা ব্যাখ্যা</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; font-weight:600; text-align:center; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; width:50px;\">১</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; font-family:Consolas, Monaco, monospace; font-size:13px; color:#0f172a; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><code>user = {&#x27;name&#x27;: &#x27;Nazmul&#x27;, &#x27;role&#x27;: &#x27;SWE&#x27;}</code></td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; color:#334155; line-height:1.6;\">`{&#x27;name&#x27;: &#x27;Nazmul&#x27;, &#x27;role&#x27;: &#x27;SWE&#x27;}` হিসাব করে তার ফলাফল `user` ভ্যারিয়েবলে অ্যাসাইন করা হচ্ছে।</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; font-weight:600; text-align:center; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; width:50px;\">২</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; font-family:Consolas, Monaco, monospace; font-size:13px; color:#0f172a; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><code>user[&#x27;level&#x27;] = &#x27;Senior&#x27;  # Insert O(1)</code></td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; color:#334155; line-height:1.6;\">কী-ভ্যালু ইনসার্ট।</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; font-weight:600; text-align:center; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; width:50px;\">৩</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; font-family:Consolas, Monaco, monospace; font-size:13px; color:#0f172a; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><code>role = user.get(&#x27;role&#x27;, &#x27;N/A&#x27;)</code></td>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; color:#334155; line-height:1.6;\">`user.get(&#x27;role&#x27;, &#x27;N/A&#x27;)` হিসাব করে তার ফলাফল `role` ভ্যারিয়েবলে অ্যাসাইন করা হচ্ছে।</td>\n        </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    \n\n      <h4 style=\"color:#0f172a; margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:6px;\">⚡ টাইম ও স্পেস কমপ্লেক্সিটি (Complexity Analysis):</h4>\n      <ul style=\"color:#334155; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:12px; padding-left:20px;\">\n        <li>⏱ <strong>Time Complexity:</strong> <span style=\"font-family:monospace; background:#e0f2fe; color:#0369a1; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;\">O(1)</span></li>\n        <li>💾 <strong>Space Complexity:</strong> <span style=\"font-family:monospace; background:#f0fdf4; color:#15803d; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px;\">O(N)</span></li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-top:16px; padding:10px 14px; background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-left:4px solid #10b981; border-radius:6px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n        <strong style=\"color:#0f172a; font-size:13.5px;\">🎯 ব্যবহৃত অ্যালগরিদম / টেকনিক (Algorithm Used):</strong>\n        <span style=\"color:#047857; font-weight:700; font-size:13.5px; margin-left:8px; background:#ecfdf5; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:4px; border:1px solid #a7f3d0;\">Hash Map</span>\n      </div>\n    "
